<title>CHINA: Sun Hung Kai Prop to offer new flats.</title>
<headline>Sun Hung Kai Prop to offer new flats.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd said on Friday  it will launch the first batch of 160 units in a residential development  in Tuen Mun in Hong Kong's New Territories at an average price of  HK$4,500 per square foot.</p>
<p>Registration for potential buyers for the flats at Botania Villa,  in Lam Tei would start on August 11 to 13 and ballot results would  be announced on August 15, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The property, which comprises 726 units in nine 11-storey blocks with  a total floor area of about 470,000 sq ft, is scheduled for completion  in June 1998, it added.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
